      <p source="#source-71459-72035"><seg source="#source-71459-71462">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71462-71489"><rb>御主意</rb><rt>ごしゆい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71489-71516"><rb>御尤</rb><rt>ごもつとも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71516-71519">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71519-71540"><rb>候</rb><rt>さふらふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71540-71543">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71543-71555"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71555-71558">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71558-71570"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71570-71573">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71573-71597"><rb>唱歌</rb><rt>しやうか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71597-71600">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71600-71615"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71615-71618">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71618-71630"><rb>止</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71630-71636">まり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71636-71657"><rb>候</rb><rt>さふらふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71657-71660">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71660-71675"><rb>淺</rb><rt>あさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71675-71684">ましい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71684-71699"><rb>哉</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71699-71702">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71702-71726"><rb>教室</rb><rt>けうしつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71726-71729">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71729-71741"><rb>慣</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71741-71744">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71744-71765"><rb>候</rb><rt>さふらふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71765-71768">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71768-71783"><rb>從</rb><rt>した<